2. Write a simple Java program where a client sends text messages to a server. 
The server must change the text to uppercase and send it straight back until the client types "bye" to close the connection.

Server.java
import java.io.*;
import java.net.*;


class Server {
    public static void main(String args[]) throws Exception {

        ServerSocket ss = new ServerSocket(5000);
        Socket s = ss.accept();

        BufferedReader br = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(s.getInputStream()));
        PrintWriter pw = new PrintWriter(s.getOutputStream(), true);

        String msg;

        while (!(msg = br.readLine()).equals("bye")) {
            pw.println(msg.toUpperCase());
        }

        pw.println("BYE");

        s.close();
        ss.close();
    }
}

